{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2021-08-31 16:05:00', 'title': 'FLOOR & DECOR HOLDINGS, INC. ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF NEW DIRECTOR', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FLOOR & DECOR HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: FND) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DWIGHT JAMES, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT – CUSTOMER ENGAGEMENT & LOYALTY FOR DELTA AIR LINES (NYSE: DAL), AND CEO OF DELTA VACATIONS, HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO FLOOR & DECOR'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. FLOOR & DECOR ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT DAVID KAPLAN, CO-FOUNDER OF ARES MANAGEMENT CORPORATION, RESIGNED FROM ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. DAVID REMARKED, “I"}